/-
The hraft kit's generated codec: the encoders of the wire structs (`rpcEnc_t4` `Header`, ...,
`rpcEnc_t33` `TimeoutResp`): each appends `rpctransport/WireEnc.lean`'s encoding of the struct's
value. A field is sent or not (`rpcSent_tN`), joined after its `if` (`wp_join`), so a struct's
proof is linear in its fields.
Generated by `etc/dsv/tools/hraft-codec.py` from the kit's `rpc_gen.go` (do not edit: change the script and rerun it).
-/
module

public import Dsverify.Proof.github_com.hashicorp.raft.examples.hraftnet.CodecPrim

